<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Survey App</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-950 text-white">
    <header class="bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-900 via-violet-900 to-pink-700 shadow-lg">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-5 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold">SurveyBuzz</div>
            <nav class="flex items-center gap-6 text-sm font-medium">
                <a href="#home" class="hover:text-pink-300">Home</a>
                <a href="#about" class="hover:text-pink-300">About</a>
                <a href="#feature" class="hover:text-pink-300">Features</a>
                <a href="#survey" class="hover:text-pink-300">Survey</a>
                <a href="/login" class="bg-green-500 hover:bg-green-400 text-black px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-semibold">Login</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main id="home" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
        <section class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center min-h-[70vh]">
            <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-sm">
                <form action="/register" method="post" class="space-y-5">
                    <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">Create your account</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-300">Start creating surveys and collect real feedback in minutes.</p>

                    <input class="w-full bg-slate-800 text-white border border-slate-600 rounded-xl p-3 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-pink-500" name="email" type="email" placeholder="examplejon@gmail.com" required>
                    <input class="w-full bg-slate-800 text-white border border-slate-600 rounded-xl p-3 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-pink-500" name="password" type="password" placeholder="Password" required>

                    <button class="w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-yellow-400 to-orange-500 text-slate-900 font-bold py-3 rounded-xl hover:opacity-90 transition" type="submit">
                        Register
                    </button>
                </form>

                <p class="mt-5 text-slate-300">
                    Already have an account?
                    <a href="/login" class="text-blue-400 underline ml-1">Login</a>
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-200 via-amber-100 to-yellow-300 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-2xl text-slate-900">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                    <span class="bg-slate-900 text-white px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">Live</span>
                    <span class="text-sm font-medium">Community feedback</span>
                </div>

                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Respond to surveys and share your opinion</h2>
                <p class="text-lg mb-6">Explore surveys from different categories and contribute your voice.</p>

                <a href="/readsurvey" class="inline-block bg-slate-900 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold hover:bg-slate-800 transition">
                    Response to surveys
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="about" class="mt-20 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <div class="bg-violet-900/70 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-violet-700">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">About</h3>
                <p class="text-violet-100">Create your survey and earn points while collecting real feedback.</p>
            </div>

            <div id="feature" class="bg-emerald-900/70 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-emerald-700">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Features</h3>
                <p class="text-emerald-100">Create surveys, share them instantly, and get quick responses from your audience.</p>
            </div>

            <div id="survey" class="bg-amber-800/70 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-amber-600">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">What is survey?</h3>
                <p class="text-amber-100">A survey is a simple way to gather opinions, ideas, and real-world feedback.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="bg-black text-slate-300 py-10 mt-10">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
            © 2026 SurveyBuzz
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>